  hendislik problemlerini saptama, tan\u305  mlama ve \u231  \u246  zme becerisi kazanabilme.\line 3. Matematik, fen ve m\u252  hendislik bilgilerini uygulama becerisi kazanabilme.\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy7048\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 Dersin Amac\u305  \par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy8127\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 \u214  \u287  renme \u199  \u305  kt\u305  lar\u305  \par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy5714\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 Dersin K\u305  sa \u304  \u231  eri\u287  i\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy9792\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\f0\fs19 Vize (%30) Quiz (%10) Final (%60)\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy9401\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 De\u287  erlendirme Kriteri\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy10755\absw9300\absh-718\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\f0\fs19 Nusret \u350  ekerda\u287  , Ak\u305  \u351  kanlar Mekani\u287  i ve Hidrolik Problemleri, Nobel, Ankara 2010Mutlu S\u252  mer, \u304  stemi \u220  nsal, Mehmet\u231  ik Bayaz\u305  t, Hidrolik, Birsen Yay\u305  nevi, 2003.Turhan Acatay, Adnan Akyarl\u305  , Ak\u305  \u351  kanlar Mekani\u287  i, \u304  MO \u304  zmir \u350  ubesi, 1999.\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy10363\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\